px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 02\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Trail Olhar Encantador 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no domingo, dia 8 de Novembro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 09:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 o local de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida tem lugar na freguesia de Padreiro Salvador e Santa Cristina, no concelho de Arcos de Valdevez.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias em prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis um Trail Longo de cerca de 23 km, um Trail Curto de 16 km e ainda uma Caminhada com cerca de 10 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso fazer a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma SincTime. Podes aceder atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o direta partilhada nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde est\u00e1 o regulamento da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento encontra-se dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download em PDF diretamente nesta p\u00e1gina ou no portal de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"7\u00ba Trail Olhar Encantador 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Padreiro Salvador e Santa Cristina\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Arcos de Valdevez\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viana do Castelo\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Olhar Encantador\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o Trail Olhar Encantador 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no domingo, dia 8 de Novembro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 o local de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida tem lugar na freguesia de Padreiro Salvador e Santa Cristina, no concelho de Arcos de Valdevez.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias em prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis um Trail Longo de cerca de 23 km, um Trail Curto de 16 km e ainda uma Caminhada com cerca de 10 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso fazer a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma SincTime. Podes aceder atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o direta partilhada nesta p\u00e1gina.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"na